xcal analysis 'goc500': tau=1.01 eps_v=0.001; 2000 cluster-bootstrap resamples over load scenarios
calibration: 5-fold cross-fitting grouped by load scenario within each evaluation set (pooled out-of-fold)
rules: max = largest calibration score; conf<a> = split-conformal over load scenarios. Base-case policies use c measured against our own NR (stronger baseline).
Bounds: cp_hi = Clopper-Pearson two-sided 95% upper limit, cp_hi1 one-sided; load = fraction of LOAD SCENARIOS with >= 1 miss (cluster level).
Sets: GOC500 Base = case500_goc_base_seed0 (638 scen, 29 load scen); GOC500 Small = case500_goc_small_seed0 (638 scen, 29 load scen); GOC500 Tiny = case500_goc_tiny_seed0 (638 scen, 29 load scen)

